w: And when un- cer- tain- ties a- rise, I trust His judg- ment, true and wise.
w: Led by His gui- dance, safe and sure, I then can rest in peace, se- cure.
w: Naught can o'er- throw me when I'm there Be- neath His ev- er- last- ing care.
w: Each bur- den God will help me bear; He hears my cry, my ev'- ry prayer.
w: Led by His hand, I will not fear; I know that God is al- ways near.
